      "path": "src/app/bench-generator.ts",
      "content": "Schedule Position Changes against the actual session close rather than a fixed UTC window. The covered calendar includes early closes (e.g. 2024-07-03 closes at 17:00Z), but this expression schedules changes as late as 19:29Z. Changes after that session's completion are therefore left pending by the event loop and recorded during the following session, after the early-close Review has already run. This changes cutoff eligibility and debt timing instead of simulating the intended one-change-per-session turnover. Pass session close timestamps into the scheduler and keep every execution before its assigned close.",
